@format 1
@id keyframes.nearest
@title Move to nearest keyframe
@area Keyframes
@entry input
@summary Dispatch the nearest-keyframe shortcut, compare the adjacent known keyframes, and propagate the selected target to the timeline and preview.
@flow TB
@related keyframes.scan, keyframes.previous, keyframes.next

@alias flow = Cadroue.UIShell.PFlow.PFlow
@alias key = Cadroue.Infrastructure.LKeyframeOrchestrator

[input] Nearest-keyframe command <input>
- Dispatch the nearest-keyframe shortcut when timeline commands and a spool are active @ flow.PFlowShortcutDispatch(...)
> find

[find] Compare adjacent keyframes <decision>
- Find the strict previous and next known keyframes, then choose the closer one; ties choose the previous keyframe @ key.LKeyframeNearestMove(...)
? "At least one adjacent keyframe is known" > move
? "No adjacent keyframe is known" > unavailable

[move] Propagate keyframe target <process>
- Update the cursor, views, keyframe scan request, and preview seek @ flow.PFlowKeyframeMove(...)
> result

[result] Nearest keyframe resolved <output>
= The cursor and preview move to the closest known keyframe; an exactly equal distance selects the earlier one.

[unavailable] No nearest keyframe <output>
= The move is deferred so nearby keyframes can be scanned later.
